     [38;5;246mOnly declared fields ship off-device; console keeps full detail with denylist scrubbing as a backstop. Fails closed
[39m     [38;5;246m— unknown fields are dropped.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Denylist scrubbing
     [38;5;246mScrub keys matching password/token/secret/auth everywhere. Low friction, but unexpected key names and interpolated
[39m     [38;5;246mstrings get through.[39m
